# Stress scene (decorrelation study, spec V-B9): the plume's ground plane plus ONE point light, no sky -- the
# unbiasedness test's lighting (VolumetricReSTIRData/plume_onelight.pyscene) with the heterogeneous plume, where
# the coarse-grid target differs most from the exact transmittance (Ghost ReSTIR's point about Lin et al.).
sceneBuilder.importScene(r'C:\research\Denoising-VolumetricReSTIR\VolumetricReSTIRData\default.obj')

light = PointLight('key')
light.intensity = float3(300, 300, 300)
light.position = float3(2.2, 3.0, 0.2)
sceneBuilder.addLight(light)
